!FormView class methodsFor: 'examples'!
readFrom: aFileName	
	"Schedule a view on a Form read from a file."

	| f view topView size |
	f _ Form  readFrom: aFileName.
	view _ self new model: f controller: (NoController new).
	topView _ StandardSystemView new label: aFileName.
	topView insideColor: (Form white).
	topView borderWidth: 2.
	size _ (f width) @ (f height) + (4@4).
	topView minimumSize: size.
	topView maximumSize: size.
	topView addSubView: view.
	topView controller open.

	"FormView readFrom: 'SmalltalkBalloon'"! !
